Brokedown Palace is a drama, thriller, mystery film directed by Jonathan Kaplan.

3
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:46,000
Best friends Alice and Darlene take a trip to
Thailand after graduating high school.

4
00:22:13,333 --> 00:22:19,333
In Thailand, they meet a captivating Australian
man, who calls himself Nick Parks.

5
00:27:46,666 --> 00:27:52,666
Darlene is particularly smitten with Nick and convinces Alice to take Nick up on his
offer to treat the two of them to what amounts to a day trip to Hong Kong.

6
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:26,000
In the airport, the girls are seized by the police and shocked to
discover that one of their bags contains heroin.

7
00:38:53,333 --> 00:38:59,333
Alice Marano, played by Claire Danes.

8
00:44:26,666 --> 00:44:32,666
