13
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
Brokedown Palace is a 1999 American drama film directed by Jonathan Kaplan,
and starring Claire Danes, Kate Beckinsale, and Bill Pullman.

14
01:17:46,666 --> 01:17:52,666
It deals with two American friends imprisoned in
Thailand for alleged drug smuggling.

15
01:23:20,000 --> 01:23:26,000
Its title is taken from a Grateful Dead song written by Jerry Garcia
and Robert Hunter from their 1970 album American Beauty.

16
01:28:53,333 --> 01:28:59,333
The film explores themes of prison, thailand, vacation, drugs, injustice.

17
01:34:26,666 --> 01:34:32,666
The tone is mind_bending and emotional and intense.
